      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i don't even exist anymore. like i'm just some part in a machine that's designed to keep running whether i'm here or not. every day is just... more of the same. work, sleep, repeat. i'm just a tool for everyone else's benefit and there's nothing left of \"me\" inside. it feels so pointless.",
